    "actual_actions": "Printed paid casts/activations, actual Taskmaster first-main target choices, real public legend choices and paid Shuri target groups. Existing checked helper exercises wrong actor atomicity, raw/index owned branches after parent disposal and restore for actual actions.",
    "bounded_limits": [
      "The external CHANGELING grant fixture uses existing typed grant machinery; no admitted card is claimed to grant it.",
      "The inverse Arc/Arc transform and source-capture continuation are explicitly bounded, after the real paid creation/overlay/copy sequence."
